 "note": "PDF page = printed page. This book is very long, so summaries and terms are given per chapter; each section is still listed with its PDF page range (section titles were parsed from the contents and a few long titles may be missing). Problems sections and the bibliography are not broken out. Summaries are in our own words; the text stays in the PDF.",
